    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify blinded otx2 and xbf1 expression intensity and spatial pattern in control, nicotine, and nicotine-plus-HCN2 embryos, testing suppression or mispatterning by nicotine and restoration by HCN2.";
